---
/**
 * Loads the measurements island, `measurements-island.ts`, which writes the
 * rendered sizes, font sizes and gaps that the measured parts show. Only
 * `Selection.astro`, `SizeTag.astro` and `Redline.astro` render it, each
 * only when it renders a measured value, so a page without one loads no
 * island. Astro bundles the island into one module and emits it once per
 * page, and the build moves it into a content-hashed same-origin file.
 *
 * Use: `{measured && <Measurements />}`, after the measured element.
 */
---

<script src="./measurements-island.ts"></script>
